    "updated_at": "2026-05-18T07:54:12Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure the opaque host parser should ever be invoked directly. That wouldn't give the IPv6 address distinction either for instance.\n\nBut we should probably document the invariants of the host parser better. E.g., I don't understand why we assert _input_ is not the empty string in step 3. That could be the first step.",
